# Hash-bound top-level archives in the controlled V10 release. Keep the global
# archive ignore above; these are the exact V10 payloads named by MANIFEST.json
# and SHA256SUMS. The frozen source snapshot has its own historical .gitignore,
# so its two nested V8.1 archives require an exact `git add -f` on first import.
!deliverables/current/2026-09-02_v10/archives/HeiQ_XMembrane_2026-09-02_v10_results.zip
!deliverables/current/2026-09-02_v10/archives/HeiQ_XMembrane_2026-09-02_v10_source.zip

